<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82226" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστέλλω</span></b> , fut. -<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στελῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1170
				</span></i>
			 :—<i>dress, clothe, wrap up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θνατὰ π. μέλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					11.15
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαρκῶν π. χιτῶνι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					126
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				2.10
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς πόδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					868b38
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεφαλὴν τοῖς κόλποις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					21.38.5
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλαμυδίῳ π. ἑαυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pyrrh.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπηξα δ᾽ αὐτὸν εὖ
			περιστείλας</span> I planted the sword <i>wrapping</i> it well
				<i>with earth</i>, i. e. planted it <i>firmly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				821
			</span></i> :—
				Med.
			, <i>wrap oneself up</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.17
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιέ</span> :—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be wrapped up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιεσταλμένον ἀναπαύεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					866a25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> Rhet.,
				<i>employ compression</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖ π. καὶ μὴ περιουσιάζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Corn.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					p.396
				</span></i>
			 H. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			<i>cut down, retrench</i> :—hence in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be dispensed with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιέσταλται ἡμῖν πᾶν τὸ τῆς δέσεως
					τῶν περιτρήτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					<u>Bel.</u>
					62.28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lay out</i> a corpse, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				24.293
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				903
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1066
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				325.12
			</span></i>, etc. (also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφον π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1170
			</span></i>); simply, <i>bury</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Hp.Ma.</u>
				291e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.613
			</span></i>(<i><span class="en">
				Diog.
			</span></i> Episc.), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Medic., in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be contracted round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιλίης περιστελλομένης ἀμφὶ τὸ
					ἔμβρυον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.34
				</span></i>
			 ; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ γαστὴρ] περισταλεῖσα τοῖς
					ἐνυπάρχουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>UP</u>
					4.7
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς σιτίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.67
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				8.440
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph.,
				<i>wrap up, cloak, cover</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τἄδικ᾽
				εὖ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				582
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἁμαρτήματα, τὴν
			ἀμαθίαν</span>, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				30.4.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.47d
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσχρορρημοσύνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.175
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμαυτὸν περιστέλλων</span>
			<i>putting on a grave countenance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Gaz.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b> c. dupl.
			acc., <i>conceal</i> something <i>from</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Lib.</u>
					p.20
				</span></i>
			 O. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>protect, defend</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλήλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.60
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλισμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.98
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοὺς νόμους</span>
			<i>maintain</i> the laws, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.147
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.31
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τοιοῦτο</span> (sc.
			monarchy) ib.<i><span class="en">
				82
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μὴ ἄναρχον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					697
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖ π. αὐτὰ δαίμονες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					447
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πάτρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					24.139
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Ἐπίκουρον</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mort.</u>
				27
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισταλεὶς ὑπὸ τῆς τῶν Ἀχαιῶν
					πρᾳότητος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.60.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>attend to, cherish</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀοιδάν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					1.33
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					17.97
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα κοσμεῖν καὶ περιστέλλειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					36.47
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ σὰ περιστέλλου κακά</span>
			<i>attend to your own</i> ills, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				1129
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>withdraw from society</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				13.120
			</span></i>.</div>
